sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant "Alice Smith" as A
  actor B as Bob
  create participant C
  A->>B: Hello **Bob**, how are you?
  activate B
  B-->>A: Fine <br/> thanks
  deactivate B
  A-)C: async ping
  B--xA: cancelled
  A<<->>B: sync both ways
  Note over A,B: A note with #quot;quotes#quot;
  alt is sick
    B->>A: Not so good :(
  else is well
    B->>A: Feeling fresh like a daisy
  end
  opt Extra response
    B->>A: Thanks for asking
  end
  loop Every minute
    A->>B: ping
  end
  par one
    A->>B: p1
  and two
    A->>C: p2
  end
  critical connect
    A->>B: c
  option timeout
    A->>B: t
  end
  break oops
    A->>B: b
  end
